  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "工程圖學(一)",
    "sub_ename": "ENGINEERING GRAPHICS(1)",
    "describe_ch": "工程圖說是所有工程建設之基礎，工程設計人員乃是藉由工程圖說傳達其設計概念與細節，施工人員則是依據工程圖說進行施工。因此，工程圖說的識讀與繪製乃是所有工程人員必備的一項基本技能。本課程內容分為上下兩學期，目的在使學生瞭解土木建築工程的製圖原理及識讀工程圖的內容，同時熟悉電腦繪圖軟體與繪圖技術，以進行工程圖的繪製。上學期講授2D工程圖識圖時，搭配3D建模軟體Sketchup；講授工程圖繪製時，則使用AutoCAD；下學期主要教授3D建模原理與技術，使用Revit。",
    "describe_eh": "Engineering drawing is the foundation of architecture, engineering, and construction (AEC) industry, where designers use it to convey their design concepts to the owner and the contractors who build the product according to it. Therefore, reading and making engineering drawings are two basic skills for all civil engineers. This course spans two semesters to make the students aware about the basic principles and reading of engineering drawings as well as capable of using CAD software to perform effective and efficient drawing. During the first semester, the reading and drawing principles of 2D drawings will be taught using Sketchup and AutoCAD. Then 3D building modeling will be taught in the second semester using Revit. Above-mentioned software versions are all 2017.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
